# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate from NoiseLearner to NoiseLearnerV3 {#migrate-from-noiselearner-to-noiselearnerv3}"
msgstr "Migrasi daripada NoiseLearner ke NoiseLearnerV3 {#migrate-from-noiselearner-to-noiselearnerv3}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide walks you through migrating from IBM Quantum&reg; `NoiseLearner` to `NoiseLearnerV3`. Both\n"
"classes perform experiments that characterize noise processes based on a\n"
"[Pauli-Lindblad noise model](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866), but the inputs and\n"
"outputs are slightly different.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini membimbing anda melalui migrasi daripada IBM Quantum&reg; `NoiseLearner` kepada `NoiseLearnerV3`. Kedua-dua\n"
"kelas ini melakukan eksperimen yang mencirikan proses hingar berdasarkan\n"
"[model hingar Pauli-Lindblad](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866), tetapi input dan\n"
"outputnya sedikit berbeza.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Latar Belakang {#background}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [`NoiseLearner`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-noise-learner)\n"
"class was created to allow users to perform explicit noise learning. The resulting\n"
"noise model can then be passed to IBM Quantum `Estimator` for applying error mitigation techniques\n"
"such as PEA and PEC.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kelas [`NoiseLearner`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-noise-learner)\n"
"dicipta untuk membolehkan pengguna melakukan pembelajaran hingar eksplisit. Model hingar\n"
"yang terhasil kemudian boleh dihantar kepada IBM Quantum `Estimator` untuk menerapkan teknik pengurangan ralat\n"
"seperti PEA dan PEC.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`NoiseLearner` was designed to work with `Estimator`, and therefore it implicitly employs the same\n"
"layer finding strategy as `Estimator`. This strategy cannot be changed; otherwise, the subsequent\n"
"mitigation steps would not work correctly.\n"
msgstr ""
"`NoiseLearner` direka untuk berfungsi dengan `Estimator`, dan oleh itu ia secara tersirat menggunakan strategi\n"
"pencarian lapisan yang sama seperti `Estimator`. Strategi ini tidak boleh diubah; jika tidak, langkah\n"
"pengurangan ralat seterusnya tidak akan berfungsi dengan betul.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Starting with `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.47.0, there is a new\n"
"[`NoiseLearnerV3`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-v3-noise-learner-v3)\n"
"class that is compatible with the `Executor` primitive and the\n"
"[directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model).\n"
"This new model delivers a **white-box** experience by providing the pieces to capture design intent\n"
"on the client side, and a single server-side primitive (Executor) processes those inputs exactly as\n"
"directed — it makes no implicit decisions on your behalf. Unlike the original `NoiseLearner`,\n"
"you control how to stratify your circuits when you use`NoiseLearnerV3`, and the class simply takes a list of boxed circuit instructions\n"
"(for example, unique layers) as its input.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bermula dengan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.47.0, terdapat kelas\n"
"[`NoiseLearnerV3`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-v3-noise-learner-v3)\n"
"baharu yang serasi dengan primitif `Executor` dan\n"
"[model pelaksanaan terarah](/guides/directed-execution-model).\n"
"Model baharu ini memberikan pengalaman **kotak putih** dengan menyediakan bahagian-bahagian untuk menangkap niat reka bentuk\n"
"pada sisi klien, dan satu primitif sisi pelayan (Executor) memproses input tersebut dengan tepat seperti\n"
"yang diarahkan — ia tidak membuat sebarang keputusan tersirat bagi pihak anda. Tidak seperti `NoiseLearner` asal,\n"
"anda mengawal cara menstratakan litar anda apabila anda menggunakan `NoiseLearnerV3`, dan kelas tersebut hanya menerima senarai arahan litar berkotak\n"
"(contohnya, lapisan unik) sebagai inputnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`NoiseLearnerV3` also supports measurement noise learning. For each instruction in the input list, it runs the\n"
"Pauli-Lindblad learning protocol if the box contains one- and two-qubit gates, and the\n"
"[TREX](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#twirled-readout-error-extinction-trex)\n"
"protocol if the box contains measurements.\n"
msgstr ""
"`NoiseLearnerV3` juga menyokong pembelajaran hingar pengukuran. Untuk setiap arahan dalam senarai input, ia menjalankan\n"
"protokol pembelajaran Pauli-Lindblad jika kotak tersebut mengandungi gate satu dan dua qubit, dan protokol\n"
"[TREX](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques#twirled-readout-error-extinction-trex)\n"
"jika kotak tersebut mengandungi pengukuran.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Should you migrate? {#should-you-migrate}"
msgstr "Perlukah anda migrasi? {#should-you-migrate}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`NoiseLearner` only works with the legacy server-side `Estimator`, and `NoiseLearnerV3` only works with\n"
"`Executor` and the client-side `Estimator`. **You must migrate to `NoiseLearnerV3` if you are using\n"
"`Executor` or client-side `Estimator`**. The legacy server-side `Estimator` is deprecated and replaced by the client-side equivalent in `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0. \n"
msgstr ""
"`NoiseLearner` hanya berfungsi dengan `Estimator` sisi pelayan warisan, dan `NoiseLearnerV3` hanya berfungsi dengan\n"
"`Executor` dan `Estimator` sisi klien. **Anda mesti migrasi ke `NoiseLearnerV3` jika anda menggunakan\n"
"`Executor` atau `Estimator` sisi klien**. `Estimator` sisi pelayan warisan telah dilapukkan (masih tersedia tetapi akan dibuang) dan digantikan dengan versi setara sisi klien dalam `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0. \n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"If you are using `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0 or later, read the [Migrate from server-side to client-side Sampler and Estimator](/guides/migrate-to-client-side-primitives) guide to migrate to client-side primitives first.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Jika anda menggunakan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0 atau lebih baharu, baca panduan [Migrasi daripada Sampler dan Estimator sisi pelayan ke sisi klien](/guides/migrate-to-client-side-primitives) untuk migrasi ke primitif sisi klien terlebih dahulu.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

